    q(next_id(), "Medium", "Vertical farming uses controlled indoor environments to grow crops in stacked layers. This method requires significantly less water than traditional agriculture, eliminates the need for pesticides, and can produce food year-round regardless of weather conditions. Despite these advantages, the high energy costs of artificial lighting and climate control systems make vertical farming economically challenging at scale.", "What is the main disadvantage of vertical farming mentioned?", ["It produces less nutritious food.", "High energy costs make it economically challenging at scale.", "It requires more water than traditional farming.", "It can only grow certain crops."], "High energy costs make it economically challenging at scale.", "The passage states that 'high energy costs of artificial lighting and climate control systems make vertical farming economically challenging at scale.'", ["reading comprehension", "supporting details"]),
