    q(next_id(), "Medium", "The Philippine agrarian reform program aimed to redistribute agricultural land from large landowners to tenant farmers. While millions of hectares have been distributed on paper, many beneficiaries report that they lack the capital, technical knowledge, and market access needed to farm productively. Without comprehensive support services, land redistribution alone has not consistently translated into improved livelihoods for farmer-beneficiaries.", "What is the passage's main argument?", ["Agrarian reform has been completely successful.", "Land redistribution without support services is insufficient to improve farmers' lives.", "Large landowners should keep their land.", "Farmers do not want to own land."], "Land redistribution without support services is insufficient to improve farmers' lives.", "The passage argues that while land has been distributed, farmers lack capital, knowledge, and market access, concluding that redistribution alone hasn't improved livelihoods.", ["reading comprehension", "main idea"]),
